if {TGO.quest("QIQ-008").is_completed()} == false:
	if {MiscellaneousCharacters.NPC-060HasSpoken} == false:
		NPC-060: Jupiter’s spot! It’s you — that mask-wearing hunter.
		set {MiscellaneousCharacters.NPC-060HasSpoken} = true
	else:
		NPC-060: Pray tell, hunter, what can I help you with?
if {TGO.quest("QIQ-008").is_completed()} == false:
	label Questions
	- What can you tell me about Oakshaw?
		Devin: What can you tell me about this place?
		NPC-060: Small enough that we all know each other. Broad enough that we can keep out of each other’s way.
		Devin: Any spirits — even strange occurrences that I should know about?
		NPC-060: None that I’ve come across, I must say. Apart from the gin.
		jump Questions
	- I should be going.
		Devin: I must leave.
		NPC-060: Yes, well, do make sure you behave appropriately. We don’t want any more troublemakers.
